{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And for dominion</b> etc. This one rules by day and this one by night, for the visibility of the moon by day is no dominion but rather like a lamp in daylight." "<b>And to divide between the light and between the darkness.</b> It does not refer to the sun and the moon, for we have already said above that they divide between the day and between the night; rather, it refers to the stars, which appear when the light departs and the darkness enters."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T23:19:29.757358799Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}